    {
      "path": "/summary",
      "value": "ESG and sustainability professional with 13+ years of overall professional experience. Proven expertise in project management, stakeholder engagement, and client relationship management, with a strong foundation across sustainability/ESG reporting, ESG due diligence, double materiality assessments, GHG accounting, and global standards compliance (GRI, BRSR, ESRS, IFRS, SASB, TCFD). Cross-sector exposure spanning financial services, media, heavy machinery, manufacturing, FMCG, power, and technology. Adept at translating regulatory requirements and global frameworks into actionable ESG strategies and audit-ready disclosures, equally suited to advisory/assurance engagements and in-house sustainability functions. Skilled at delivering high-impact ESG and risk briefings to C-suite leaders and Operating Committees to align corporate strategy. Committed to aligning business strategy with sustainability goals through rigorous, high-quality ESG reporting.",
